<p id="S2.I2.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><math id="S2.I2.i3.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\mathsf{D}}_{\rm adm}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>𝖣</mi><mi>adm</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\mathsf{D}}_{\rm adm}</annotation></semantics></math>, “<math id="S2.I2.i3.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(2,2)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(2,2)</annotation></semantics></math> ramification”. These covers have dual graph <math id="S2.I2.i3.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\Gamma_{D_{\rm adm}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Γ</mi><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>adm</mi></msub></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Gamma_{D_{\rm adm}}</annotation></semantics></math>:</p>
