<p id="S4.SS1.SSS1.p3.2" class="ltx_p">The pencil has a unique split fiber, corresponding to an intersection with a new divisor <math id="S4.SS1.SSS1.p3.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\Delta_{{\rm split}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mi>split</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Delta_{{\rm split}}</annotation></semantics></math> with dual graph <math id="S4.SS1.SSS1.p3.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\Gamma_{\Delta_{{\rm split}}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Γ</mi><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mi>split</mi></msub></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Gamma_{\Delta_{{\rm split}}}</annotation></semantics></math>:</p>
