<p id="S4.SS1.SSS4.p4.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S4.SS1.SSS4.p4.1.1" class="ltx_text">The family <math id="S4.SS1.SSS4.p4.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="p^{\prime}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mi>p</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p^{\prime}</annotation></semantics></math> also has an intersection with an <span id="S4.SS1.SSS4.p4.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_slanted">unramified</span> boundary divisor <math id="S4.SS1.SSS4.p4.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\Delta_{{\rm ram}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mi>ram</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Delta_{{\rm ram}}</annotation></semantics></math> which has dual graph <math id="S4.SS1.SSS4.p4.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\Gamma_{\Delta_{{\rm ram}}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Γ</mi><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mi>ram</mi></msub></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Gamma_{\Delta_{{\rm ram}}}</annotation></semantics></math>:</span></p>
