</table>
</div>
</div>
<div id="S4.SS1.SSS5.2" class="ltx_proof">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_font_italic ltx_title_proof">Proof.</h6>
<div id="S4.SS1.SSS5.p3" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S4.SS1.SSS5.p3.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S4.SS1.SSS5.p3.1.1" class="ltx_text">Similar to <a href="#S4.Thmthm10" title="Proposition 4.10. ‣ 4.1.5 
            
              2
            
          -vertex divisors III. ‣ 4.1 Degree three analysis. ‣ 4 The slope problem. ‣ Special Codimension One Loci in Hurwitz Spaces" class="ltx_ref ltx_refmacro_autoref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4.10</span></a>.
∎</span></p>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<section id="S4.SS1.SSS6" class="ltx_subsubsection">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_font_bold ltx_title_subsubsection">4.1.6 Inequalities III.</h4>

<div id="S4.SS1.SSS6.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S4.SS1.SSS6.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Let <math id="S4.SS1.SSS6.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\Delta" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Delta</annotation></semantics></math> be a triply ramified, <math id="S4.SS1.SSS6.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="2" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>2</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">2</annotation></semantics></math>-vertex divisor with dual graph <math id="S4.SS1.SSS6.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\Gamma_{\Delta}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Γ</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Gamma_{\Delta}</annotation></semantics></math>:</p>
<table id="S4.Ex31" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="S4.Ex31.m1.pic1" class="ltx_picture ltx_markedasmath" height="29.86" overflow="visible" style="vertical-align:-15.051833686284938px" version="1.1" viewBox="22.55 15.05 124.11 29.86" width="124.11"><g transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 22.554884515099626 29.857672974663156) translate(0,3.46) translate(22.56,0)"><g transform="translate(-3.46,0) translate(0,-3.07)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:0.5em;--ltx-fo-height:0.44em;--ltx-fo-depth:0em;font-size:10pt;" height="6.15" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 6.15)" width="6.92"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content"><math id="S4.Ex31.m1.pic1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\textstyle{\bullet}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>∙</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\textstyle{\bullet}</annotation></semantics></math></span></span></foreignObject></g><g transform="translate(-22.56,0) translate(0,7.87) translate(4.15,0) translate(0,-1.39)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:0.95em;--ltx-fo-height:0.3em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.1em;font-size:10pt;" height="5.56" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 4.17)" width="13.19"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content"><math id="S4.Ex31.m1.pic1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\textstyle{\scriptstyle v_{L}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi mathsize="0.700em">v</mi><mi mathsize="0.710em">L</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\textstyle{\scriptstyle v_{L}}</annotation></semantics></math></span></span></foreignObject></g><g transform="translate(-22.49,0) translate(0,-7.87) translate(4.15,0) translate(0,-1.14)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:0.94em;--ltx-fo-height:0.3em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.14em;font-size:10pt;" height="6.05" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 4.17)" width="13.05"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content"><math id="S4.Ex31.m1.pic1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\textstyle{\scriptstyle g_{L}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi mathsize="0.700em">g</mi><mi mathsize="0.710em">L</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\textstyle{\scriptstyle g_{L}}</annotation></semantics></math></span></span></foreignObject></g><g transform="translate(75.28,0) translate(0,-3.07)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:0.5em;--ltx-fo-height:0.44em;--ltx-fo-depth:0em;font-size:10pt;" height="6.15" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 6.15)" width="6.92"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content"><math id="S4.Ex31.m1.pic1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\textstyle{\bullet}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>∙</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\textstyle{\bullet}</annotation></semantics></math></span></span></foreignObject></g><g transform="translate(79.55,0) translate(0,7.87) translate(4.15,0) translate(0,-1.39)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:0.99em;--ltx-fo-height:0.3em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.1em;font-size:10pt;" height="5.56" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 4.17)" width="13.71"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content"><math id="S4.Ex31.m1.pic1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\textstyle{\scriptstyle v_{R}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi mathsize="0.700em">v</mi><mi mathsize="0.710em">R</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\textstyle{\scriptstyle v_{R}}</annotation></semantics></math></span></span></foreignObject></g><g transform="translate(79.61,0) translate(0,-7.87) translate(4.15,0) translate(0,-1.14)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:0.98em;--ltx-fo-height:0.3em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.14em;font-size:10pt;" height="6.05" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 4.17)" width="13.57"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content"><math id="S4.Ex31.m1.pic1.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\textstyle{\scriptstyle g_{R}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi mathsize="0.700em">g</mi><mi mathsize="0.710em">R</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\textstyle{\scriptstyle g_{R}}</annotation></semantics></math></span></span></foreignObject></g><path style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;" d="M 3.459271148179137 -0.27673578005007266 L 3.459271148179137 0.27673578005007266" fill="none" stroke="#000000"></path><g transform="translate(32.46,0) translate(0,7.27) translate(4.15,0) translate(0,-3.12)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:0.4em;--ltx-fo-height:0.45em;--ltx-fo-depth:0em;font-size:10pt;" height="6.24" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 6.24)" width="5.52"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content"><math id="S4.Ex31.m1.pic1.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\scriptstyle{3}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn mathsize="0.700em">3</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\scriptstyle{3}</annotation></semantics></math></span></span></foreignObject></g><path style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;" d="M 3.459271148179137 -0.27673578005007266 L 75.28087319848744 0.27673578005007266" fill="none" stroke="#000000"></path><path style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;" d="M 75.28087319848744 -0.27673578005007266 L 75.28087319848744 0.27673578005007266" fill="none" stroke="#000000"></path></g></svg></span></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="S4.SS1.SSS6.p1.2" class="ltx_p">We consider the partial pencil <math id="S4.SS1.SSS6.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="p^{\prime\prime}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mi>p</mi><mo>′′</mo></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p^{\prime\prime}</annotation></semantics></math> constructed in the previous section.</p>
</div>
<div id="S4.Thmthm11" class="ltx_theorem ltx_theorem_lem">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_title_theorem"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_theorem"><span id="S4.Thmthm11.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Lemma 4.11</span></span><span id="S4.Thmthm11.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">.</span></h6>
<div id="S4.Thmthm11.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S4.Thmthm11.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S4.Thmthm11.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">We have the following inequality:</span></p>
<table id="S4.E3" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="S4.E3.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="c(\Delta,{{\mathsf{Y}}})\geq c(\Delta_{{\rm split}},{{\mathsf{Y}}})+c(\Delta_{{\rm ram}},{{\mathsf{Y}}})+6g-5g_{R}" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>𝖸</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>≥</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mi>split</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝖸</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mi>ram</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝖸</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>g</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>R</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">c(\Delta,{{\mathsf{Y}}})\geq c(\Delta_{{\rm split}},{{\mathsf{Y}}})+c(\Delta_{{\rm ram}},{{\mathsf{Y}}})+6g-5g_{R}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(4.3)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
</div>
<div id="S4.SS1.SSS6.2" class="ltx_proof">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_font_italic ltx_title_proof">Proof.</h6>
<div id="S4.SS1.SSS6.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S4.SS1.SSS6.p2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S4.SS1.SSS6.p2.1.1" class="ltx_text">We intersect <math id="S4.SS1.SSS6.p2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="p^{\prime\prime}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mi>p</mi><mo>′′</mo></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p^{\prime\prime}</annotation></semantics></math> with <math id="S4.SS1.SSS6.p2.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\mathsf{X}}=a\lambda-b\delta-{{\mathsf{Y}}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝖷</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>λ</mi></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>δ</mi></mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>𝖸</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\mathsf{X}}=a\lambda-b\delta-{{\mathsf{Y}}}</annotation></semantics></math> and use <a href="#S4.Thmthm10" title="Proposition 4.10. ‣ 4.1.5 
            
              2
            
          -vertex divisors III. ‣ 4.1 Degree three analysis. ‣ 4 The slope problem. ‣ Special Codimension One Loci in Hurwitz Spaces" class="ltx_ref ltx_refmacro_autoref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4.10</span></a>.
∎</span></p>
</div>
</div>
<div id="S4.Thmthm12" class="ltx_theorem ltx_theorem_cor">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_title_theorem"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_theorem"><span id="S4.Thmthm12.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Corollary 4.12</span></span><span id="S4.Thmthm12.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">.</span></h6>
<div id="S4.Thmthm12.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S4.Thmthm12.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S4.Thmthm12.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Keep the setting of the previous lemma. If <math id="S4.Thmthm12.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="c(\Delta_{{\rm split}},{{\mathsf{Y}}})\geq 0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mi>split</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝖸</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">c(\Delta_{{\rm split}},{{\mathsf{Y}}})\geq 0</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="S4.Thmthm12.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="c(\Delta_{{\rm ram}},{{\mathsf{Y}}})\geq 0," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mi>ram</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝖸</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">c(\Delta_{{\rm ram}},{{\mathsf{Y}}})\geq 0,</annotation></semantics></math> then <math id="S4.Thmthm12.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="c(\Delta,{{\mathsf{Y}}})\geq 0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>𝖸</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">c(\Delta,{{\mathsf{Y}}})\geq 0</annotation></semantics></math>.</span></p>
</div>
</div>
<div id="S4.SS1.SSS6.3" class="ltx_proof">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_font_italic ltx_title_proof">Proof.</h6>
<div id="S4.SS1.SSS6.p3" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S4.SS1.SSS6.p3.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S4.SS1.SSS6.p3.1.1" class="ltx_text">Clear.
∎</span></p>
</div>
</div>
<div id="S4.Thmthm13" class="ltx_theorem ltx_theorem_prop">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_title_theorem"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_theorem"><span id="S4.Thmthm13.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Proposition 4.13</span></span><span id="S4.Thmthm13.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">.</span></h6>
<div id="S4.Thmthm13.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S4.Thmthm13.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S4.Thmthm13.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Keeping the same setting as the previous corollary, we have:</span></p>
<table id="S4.Ex32" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="S4.Ex32.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="c(\Delta,{\mathsf{Y}})\geq 0." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>𝖸</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">c(\Delta,{\mathsf{Y}})\geq 0.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
</div>
<div id="S4.SS1.SSS6.4" class="ltx_proof">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_font_italic ltx_title_proof">Proof.</h6>
<div id="S4.SS1.SSS6.p4" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S4.SS1.SSS6.p4.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S4.SS1.SSS6.p4.1.1" class="ltx_text">The split fiber in <math id="S4.SS1.SSS6.p4.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="p^{\prime\prime}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mi>p</mi><mo>′′</mo></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p^{\prime\prime}</annotation></semantics></math> provides an intersection with the divisor <math id="S4.SS1.SSS6.p4.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\Delta_{{\rm split}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mi>split</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Delta_{{\rm split}}</annotation></semantics></math> whose dual graph looks like:
<math id="S4.SS1.SSS6.p4.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\Gamma_{\Delta_{{\rm split}}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Γ</mi><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mi>split</mi></msub></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Gamma_{\Delta_{{\rm split}}}</annotation></semantics></math>:</span></p>
