<p id="S4.SS1.SSS6.p4.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="S4.SS1.SSS6.p4.2.1" class="ltx_text">The reduced ramification fiber provides an intersection with the <span id="S4.SS1.SSS6.p4.2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_slanted">simply ramified</span> boundary divisor <math id="S4.SS1.SSS6.p4.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\Delta_{{\rm ram}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mi>ram</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Delta_{{\rm ram}}</annotation></semantics></math> which has dual graph <math id="S4.SS1.SSS6.p4.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\Gamma_{\Delta_{{\rm ram}}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Γ</mi><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mi>ram</mi></msub></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Gamma_{\Delta_{{\rm ram}}}</annotation></semantics></math>:</span></p>
