<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="S4.SS1.SSS7.p2.2" class="ltx_p">(Notice that the effect is a reduction of the genus of <math id="S4.SS1.SSS7.p2.m10" class="ltx_Math" alttext="v_{R}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>R</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">v_{R}</annotation></semantics></math> by one.)</p>
