<div id="S4.SS1.SSS7.p3" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S4.SS1.SSS7.p3.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S4.SS1.SSS7.p3.1.1" class="ltx_text">Standard - we omit it.
∎</span></p>
