<div id="S4.Thmthm15" class="ltx_theorem ltx_theorem_lem">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_title_theorem"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_theorem"><span id="S4.Thmthm15.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Lemma 4.15</span></span><span id="S4.Thmthm15.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">.</span></h6>
<div id="S4.Thmthm15.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S4.Thmthm15.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S4.Thmthm15.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Keeping the setting above, we have:</span></p>
<table id="S4.E4" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="S4.E4.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="c(\Delta,{{\mathsf{Y}}})\geq g(g_{R}+2)-6g_{R}+c(\Delta_{{\rm split}},{{\mathsf{Y}}})" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>𝖸</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>≥</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>R</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>R</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mi>split</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝖸</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">c(\Delta,{{\mathsf{Y}}})\geq g(g_{R}+2)-6g_{R}+c(\Delta_{{\rm split}},{{\mathsf{Y}}})</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(4.4)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
</div>
<div id="S4.SS1.SSS7.3" class="ltx_proof">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_font_italic ltx_title_proof">Proof.</h6>
<div id="S4.SS1.SSS7.p4" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S4.SS1.SSS7.p4.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S4.SS1.SSS7.p4.1.1" class="ltx_text">Intersect <math id="S4.SS1.SSS7.p4.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="p" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>p</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p</annotation></semantics></math> with <math id="S4.SS1.SSS7.p4.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\mathsf{X}}=a\lambda-b\delta-{{\mathsf{Y}}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝖷</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>λ</mi></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>δ</mi></mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>𝖸</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\mathsf{X}}=a\lambda-b\delta-{{\mathsf{Y}}}</annotation></semantics></math> and use <a href="#S4.Thmthm14" title="Proposition 4.14. ‣ 4.1.7 
            
              3
            
           vertices. ‣ 4.1 Degree three analysis. ‣ 4 The slope problem. ‣ Special Codimension One Loci in Hurwitz Spaces" class="ltx_ref ltx_refmacro_autoref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4.14</span></a>.
∎</span></p>
</div>
</div>
<div id="S4.Thmthm16" class="ltx_theorem ltx_theorem_cor">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_title_theorem"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_theorem"><span id="S4.Thmthm16.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Corollary 4.16</span></span><span id="S4.Thmthm16.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">.</span></h6>
<div id="S4.Thmthm16.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S4.Thmthm16.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S4.Thmthm16.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Keep the setting of the previous lemma. If <math id="S4.Thmthm16.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="c(\Delta_{{\rm split}},{{\mathsf{Y}}})\geq 0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mi>split</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝖸</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">c(\Delta_{{\rm split}},{{\mathsf{Y}}})\geq 0</annotation></semantics></math> then <math id="S4.Thmthm16.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="c(\Delta,{{\mathsf{Y}}})\geq 0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>𝖸</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">c(\Delta,{{\mathsf{Y}}})\geq 0</annotation></semantics></math>.</span></p>
</div>
</div>
<div id="S4.SS1.SSS7.4" class="ltx_proof">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_font_italic ltx_title_proof">Proof.</h6>
<div id="S4.SS1.SSS7.p5" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S4.SS1.SSS7.p5.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S4.SS1.SSS7.p5.1.1" class="ltx_text">Clear.
∎</span></p>
</div>
</div>
<div id="S4.Thmthm17" class="ltx_theorem ltx_theorem_prop">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_title_theorem"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_theorem"><span id="S4.Thmthm17.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Proposition 4.17</span></span><span id="S4.Thmthm17.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">.</span></h6>
<div id="S4.Thmthm17.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S4.Thmthm17.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S4.Thmthm17.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Keeping the same setting as the previous corollary, we have:</span></p>
<table id="S4.Ex42" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="S4.Ex42.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="c(\Delta,{\mathsf{Y}})\geq 0." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>𝖸</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">c(\Delta,{\mathsf{Y}})\geq 0.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
</div>
<div id="S4.SS1.SSS7.5" class="ltx_proof">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_font_italic ltx_title_proof">Proof.</h6>
<div id="S4.SS1.SSS7.p6" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S4.SS1.SSS7.p6.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S4.SS1.SSS7.p6.1.1" class="ltx_text">By repeatedly use relation <a href="#S4.Thmthm16" title="Corollary 4.16. ‣ 4.1.7 
            
              3
            
           vertices. ‣ 4.1 Degree three analysis. ‣ 4 The slope problem. ‣ Special Codimension One Loci in Hurwitz Spaces" class="ltx_ref ltx_refmacro_autoref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4.16</span></a>, we must only show that <math id="S4.SS1.SSS7.p6.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="c(\Delta_{0},{{\mathsf{Y}}})\geq 0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝖸</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">c(\Delta_{0},{{\mathsf{Y}}})\geq 0</annotation></semantics></math> for <math id="S4.SS1.SSS7.p6.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="E_{0}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>E</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">E_{0}</annotation></semantics></math> having dual graph <math id="S4.SS1.SSS7.p6.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\Gamma_{\Delta_{0}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Γ</mi><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Gamma_{\Delta_{0}}</annotation></semantics></math>:</span></p>
<table id="S4.Ex43" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="S4.Ex43.m1.pic1" class="ltx_picture ltx_markedasmath" height="40.74" overflow="visible" style="vertical-align:-25.930186929223744px" version="1.1" viewBox="23.46 25.93 125.02 40.74" width="125.02"><g transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 23.457068072095094 40.73602621760196) translate(0,3.46) translate(23.46,0)"><g transform="translate(-3.46,0) translate(0,-9.84) translate(0,-3.07)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:0.5em;--ltx-fo-height:0.44em;--ltx-fo-depth:0em;font-size:10pt;" height="6.15" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 6.15)" width="6.92"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content"><math id="S4.Ex43.m1.pic1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\textstyle{\bullet}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>∙</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\textstyle{\bullet}</annotation></semantics></math></span></span></foreignObject></g><g transform="translate(-23.46,0) translate(0,-17.72) translate(4.15,0) translate(0,-2.18)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:1.08em;--ltx-fo-height:0.45em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.14em;font-size:10pt;" height="8.13" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 6.24)" width="14.99"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content"><math id="S4.Ex43.m1.pic1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\textstyle{\scriptstyle g-1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi mathsize="0.700em">g</mi><mo mathsize="0.700em">−</mo><mn mathsize="0.700em">1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\textstyle{\scriptstyle g-1}</annotation></semantics></math></span></span></foreignObject></g><g transform="translate(-22.56,0) translate(0,-1.97) translate(4.15,0) translate(0,-1.39)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:0.95em;--ltx-fo-height:0.3em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.1em;font-size:10pt;" height="5.56" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 4.17)" width="13.19"><span clas