<div id="S4.SS3.SSS1.p4" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S4.SS3.SSS1.p4.1" class="ltx_p">The interactions of <math id="S4.SS3.SSS1.p4.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="p" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>p</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p</annotation></semantics></math> are given in the next proposition:</p>
</div>
<div id="S4.Thmthm22" class="ltx_theorem ltx_theorem_prop">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_title_theorem"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_theorem"><span id="S4.Thmthm22.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Proposition 4.22</span></span><span id="S4.Thmthm22.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">.</span></h6>
<div id="S4.Thmthm22.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S4.Thmthm22.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S4.Thmthm22.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">The pencil <math id="S4.Thmthm22.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="p" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>p</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p</annotation></semantics></math> has the following intersection numbers:</span></p>
<table id="S4.EGx24" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="S4.Ex54"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
