<div id="S4.Thmthm26" class="ltx_theorem ltx_theorem_prop">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_title_theorem"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_theorem"><span id="S4.Thmthm26.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Proposition 4.26</span></span><span id="S4.Thmthm26.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">.</span></h6>
<div id="S4.Thmthm26.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S4.Thmthm26.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S4.Thmthm26.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">In the setting above,</span></p>
<table id="S4.Ex73" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="S4.Ex73.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="c(\Delta,{\mathsf{Y}})\geq 0." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>𝖸</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">c(\Delta,{\mathsf{Y}})\geq 0.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
</div>
<div id="S4.SS3.SSS4.3" class="ltx_proof">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_font_italic ltx_title_proof">Proof.</h6>
<div id="S4.SS3.SSS4.p5" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S4.SS3.SSS4.p5.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S4.SS3.SSS4.p5.1.1" class="ltx_text">The divisor <math id="S4.SS3.SSS4.p5.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\Delta_{{\rm split}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mi>split</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Delta_{{\rm split}}</annotation></semantics></math>, originating from the split fiber of <math id="S4.SS3.SSS4.p5.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="p^{\prime}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mi>p</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p^{\prime}</annotation></semantics></math>, has dual graph <math id="S4.SS3.SSS4.p5.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\Gamma_{\Delta_{{\rm split}}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Γ</mi><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mi>split</mi></msub></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Gamma_{\Delta_{{\rm split}}}</annotation></semantics></math>:</span></p>
<table id="S4.Ex74" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

