<div id="S4.SS5.SSS4.p4" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S4.SS5.SSS4.p4.1" class="ltx_p">We now collect the relevant intersection numbers of <math id="S4.SS5.SSS4.p4.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="p" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>p</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p</annotation></semantics></math>.</p>
